OL,3,GNEWSAHouse up for auction for #17k -
OL,4,Abut it doesn't have a roof
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt dates from the 13th Century, and
OL,7,Fonce belonged to the Goodman family of
OL,8,FRuthin. In 1650 Godfrey Goodman - the
OL,9,FBishop of Gloucester - was banished
OL,10,Fthere by Oliver Cromwell for his
OL,11,Freligious beliefs.
